ot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(y^{2})+2 x\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(y) \\\\  & =3 x^{2}\\cdot (2 y)+2 x\\cdot (1) \\\\  & =6 y x^{2}+2 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(1,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂y}{|}_{(1,1)} & =6 (1) (1)^{2}+2 (1) \\\\  & =6+(2) \\\\  & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["5cb4fff8-45ad-50c3-8b2e-9b437dd13890"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "45f467e8-e600-5a7b-8133-7812e4904ae9" :answer/id #uuid "45f467e8-e600-5a7b-8133-7812e4904ae9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "29a08cee-ed02-5faf-a682-255c5139e134" :answer/id #uuid "29a08cee-ed02-5faf-a682-255c5139e134" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e55c0a40-c359-5478-8e4c-9a627191e993" :answer/id #uuid "e55c0a40-c359-5478-8e4c-9a627191e993" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "dd410a64-adab-5eb3-b6b4-3a9d9d8cdef9" :answer/id #uuid "dd410a64-adab-5eb3-b6b4-3a9d9d8cdef9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fdee8958-2bb7-5874-bfe6-048f32451748" :answer/id #uuid "fdee8958-2bb7-5874-bfe6-048f32451748" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-7" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "26db9502-5c6f-59a9-b551-456ea58a9398" :answer-field/id #uuid "26db9502-5c6f-59a9-b551-456ea58a9398" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["45f467e8-e600-5a7b-8133-7812e4904ae9" "29a08cee-ed02-5faf-a682-255c5139e134" "e55c0a40-c359-5478-8e4c-9a627191e993" "dd410a64-adab-5eb3-b6b4-3a9d9d8cdef9" "fdee8958-2bb7-5874-bfe6-048f32451748"] :answer-field/correct "dd410a64-adab-5eb3-b6b4-3a9d9d8cdef9" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "cf3c77be-ed81-5de6-b0a0-3c22ecd64ed6" :question/id #uuid "cf3c77be-ed81-5de6-b0a0-3c22ecd64ed6" :question/problem "For the function $f(x,y)=3 y^{2} x^{2}+y x,$ evaluate $\\frac{∂f}{∂y}$ at the point $(1,-1).$" :question/worked-solution "We differentiate the given function with respect to $y,$ treating all other variables as constants:\n\nAdditionally, we use the sum and constant multiple rules for differentiation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3 y^{2} x^{2}+y x) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3 y^{2} x^{2})+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(y x) \\\\  & =3 x^{2}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(y^{2})+x\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(y) \\\\  & =3 x^{2}\\cdot (2 y)+x\\cdot (1) \\\\  & =6 y x^{2}+x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(1,-1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂y}{|}_{(1,-1)} & =6 (-1) (1)^{2}+(1) \\\\  & =-6+(1) \\\\  & =-5\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["26db9502-5c6f-59a9-b551-456ea58a9398"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "2ea927af-1007-572a-922f-4aefb0c8767e" :answer/id #uuid "2ea927af-1007-572a-922f-4aefb0c8767e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-11" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7176a7f5-da12-53cf-9ffd-85f92b2fb510" :answer/id #uuid "7176a7f5-da12-53cf-9ffd-85f92b2fb510" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e1c4d2a1-1c92-5c12-9540-6b62a7ee553f" :answer/id #uuid "e1c4d2a1-1c92-5c12-9540-6b62a7ee553f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "61615a5c-1c97-5ca0-97b9-f795b28e5c8c" :answer/id #uuid "61615a5c-1c97-5ca0-97b9-f795b28e5c8c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-13" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "64686f40-7ee7-549c-8a01-588a18b5d8b9" :answer/id #uuid "64686f40-7ee7-549c-8a01-588a18b5d8b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "371473f6-d498-5af3-980f-2a37043ccdd6" :answer-field/id #uuid "371473f6-d498-5af3-980f-2a37043ccdd6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["2ea927af-1007-572a-922f-4aefb0c8767e" "7176a7f5-da12-53cf-9ffd-85f92b2fb510" "e1c4d2a1-1c92-5c12-9540-6b62a7ee553f" "61615a5c-1c97-5ca0-97b9-f795b28e5c8c" "64686f40-7ee7-549c-8a01-588a18b5d8b9"] :answer-field/correct "2ea927af-1007-572a-922f-4aefb0c8767e" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "f71f04b5-8161-5a16-8003-15968bea5986" :question/id #uuid "f71f04b5-8161-5a16-8003-15968bea5986" :question/problem "For the function $f(x,y)=3 x^{2} y^{2}+x y,$ evaluate $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}$ at the point $(-2,1).$" :question/worked-solution "We differentiate the given function with respect to $x,$ treating all other variables as constants:\n\nAdditionally, we use the sum and constant multiple rules for differentiation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(3 x^{2} y^{2}+x y) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(3 x^{2} y^{2})+\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x y) \\\\  & =3 y^{2}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(x^{2})+y\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(x) \\\\  & =3 y^{2}\\cdot (2 x)+y\\cdot (1) \\\\  & =6 x y^{2}+y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(-2,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}{|}_{(-2,1)} & =6 (-2) (1)^{2}+(1) \\\\  & =-12+(1) \\\\  & =-11\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["371473f6-d498-5af3-980f-2a37043ccdd6"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "3d071372-a702-5054-9530-d8a986bccb43" :answer/id #uuid "3d071372-a702-5054-9530-d8a986bccb43" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "bbb7a185-f349-5e40-ac52-62cecf93127c" :answer/id #uuid "bbb7a185-f349-5e40-ac52-62cecf93127c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "281c0703-b852-50f5-8381-792285de4691" :answer/id #uuid "281c0703-b852-50f5-8381-792285de4691" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "42ae0e48-13dc-5b0f-b8c1-406c19758160" :answer/id #uuid "42ae0e4