 with respect to $y,$ treating all other variables as constants:\n\nAdditionally, we use the sum and constant multiple rules for differentiation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{y}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x \\sec{(y )}+y x^{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x \\sec{(y )})+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(y x^{4}) \\\\  & =x\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\sec{(y )})+x^{4}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(y) \\\\  & =x\\cdot (\\sec{(y )} \\tan{(y )})+x^{4}\\cdot (1) \\\\  & =x \\sec{(y )} \\tan{(y )}+x^{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(- \\sqrt{2},\\frac{\\pi}{4}):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{y}(- \\sqrt{2},\\frac{\\pi}{4}) & =(- \\sqrt{2}) \\sec{((\\frac{\\pi}{4}) )} \\tan{((\\frac{\\pi}{4}) )}+(- \\sqrt{2})^{4} \\\\  & =(- \\sqrt{2})\\cdot (\\sqrt{2})\\cdot (1)+(4) \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["d4dd3c96-722f-59d8-a3ad-81a44cf6e35a"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "6ffc4f7b-9b5a-54f8-988b-2b4205a94a9c" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186124644-draft.py"} [:db/add 17592186124644 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186124644 :knowledge-point/questions ["e2c0e388-7239-552d-8839-6c9035d1a779" "cf3c77be-ed81-5de6-b0a0-3c22ecd64ed6" "f71f04b5-8161-5a16-8003-15968bea5986" "3650aa55-ef47-53fa-ba3d-5f154dc4d603" "147e9a52-51e2-5c74-9d4e-fa093aa4d65f" "c63a6c19-50b5-5979-ba7a-341fdd52675a"]} [:db/ensure 17592186124644 :knowledge-point/validate]]
